   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Appropriation Bill (No. 2) 2022‑2023 proposes $13.3 billion in spending, including $7.7 billion for Defence, $3.9 billion for infrastructure, and $495 million for Airservices Australia, with a $3 billion Advance to the Finance Minister for COVID‑19 measures and $600 million for other urgent expenditure."
